<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.draft.prunes ~ the drafts no one touched lately

`lares wiki prune-stale <slug>` asks the daemon for the wiki's draft tiddlers idle past a threshold (`--days <N>`), each with its last update and days idle, so the operator acts on residency or prunes. It surfaces; it removes nothing.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ prune

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`prune` params=`slug/works days/30 ~ surface drafts idle thirty days`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ slug · days

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`slug` params=`takes/slug needs/required seat/1 as/<slug> ~ the wiki slug`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`days` params=`takes/count ~ the idle threshold in days`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ vessel

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`vessel` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the daemon verb runs under the vessel's own did; this handler checks no ocap of its own`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · daemon-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[engine.draft.prunes slug/works]] ~ name the slug`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`daemon-refused` params=`~ the daemon's prune-stale verb refused; its message rides the line, exit 4`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ surfaced

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`surfaced` params=`exit/0 fields/[[stale]] ~ each stale title, its last update and days idle`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares wiki prune-stale

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares wiki prune-stale]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

